    "description": "Get the sounds of the top memes in one click and offline, plus you can:\r\n\u2022 Watch the meme video\r\n\u2022 Share meme sound\r\n\u2022 Save meme sound to device\r\n\r\nJust hold the button to display the menu with options.\r\n\r\n~~~One Click to Play~~~\r\n~~~Hold to the options menu~~~\r\n\r\nOnly the option to \"Watch the video\" requires internet.\r\n\r\nSend meme suggestions by going to favorites, there is the option to send them.\r\n\r\nLeave your comment with the meme you want added, along with a 5 star rating :D",
